OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAfter a cooler, fresher start
OL,6,Fthan of late, Friday will be a mostly
OL,7,Fdry day with plenty of sunny spells.
OL,8,FWinds will be generally light and it
OL,9,Fwill feel pleasantly warm in the
OL,10,Fsunshine.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA dry night will follow with
OL,13,Fclear spells and generally light winds
OL,14,Ffor all. Feeling rather cool and fresh
OL,15,Fonce again.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FWinds reaming generally
OL,18,Flight with plenty of sunny spells. An
OL,19,Fisolated light shower is possible, but
OL,20,Fmost staying dry. Feeling pleasant in
OL,21,Fthe sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
